│ PROCPTR      │ FE00 │ FBCC            │ Interpreter: the next program byte (Z-80)                          │
│ CURTOP       │ F89E │ 40C5 → Z80 C0C5 │ Block of the current line                                          │
│ LBCUR        │ F1C1 │ 05              │ ADTBL index of the current line                                    │
